  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kizazi Hodari (OVC-Nextgen) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Kizazi Hodari (OVC-nextgen) activity is to support the government of tanzania (GOT) and community systems and structures to improve the health, well-being, and protection of orphans and vulnerable children (OVC) and youth in high hiv burden communities within the northeastern zone of Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
